<p>You willingly fry a few parts of your yeti's brain to trigger a huge psionic blast in cone of radius 5.</p><p>Any foes caught in the blast will suffer <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>Constitution 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">50, 117, 193, 251, 300</acronym> mind damage and be confused (35% power) for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 3, 4, 4</acronym> turns.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Constitution and the apply power will be the highest of your mind, spell, or physical power.</p>